          "bbox": [
            0.193,
            0.85,
            0.837,
            0.87
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iv) The cube of a 2-digit number may have seven or more digits."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
